---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Trip Planning | Portugal Considered";
const description =
  "Plan a better Portugal vacation by deciding how long to stay, how to get around, where to base yourself, and how to put the trip together.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="planning-intro">
    <div class="planning-intro-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Plan Portugal with intention</p>

      <h1>Build a Portugal trip that makes sense.</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        A better Portugal vacation is not about fitting in the most places.
        It is about making a few important decisions well: how long to stay,
        where to base yourself, how to travel between destinations, and what
        deserves your time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="planning-section">
    <article class="planning-feature">
      <div class="planning-image">
        <img
          src="/images/porto-douro-riverfront-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers walking along the Douro River waterfront in Porto"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="planning-content">
        <p class="section-label">Start with your time</p>

        <h2>How long do you really need?</h2>

        <p>
          The number of days you have changes almost every other decision.
          A short Portugal trip may be better with one or two strong bases,
          while a longer trip gives you room to add regions without turning
          every few days into another travel day.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our planning guides help you decide how much time Portugal and its
          individual destinations deserve before you start filling the
          itinerary.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="planning-feature planning-feature-reverse">
      <div class="planning-image">
        <img
          src="/images/portugal-train-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers boarding a passenger train in Portugal"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="planning-content">
        <p class="section-label">Move thoughtfully</p>

        <h2>Train, car, or transfer?</h2>

        <p>
          Portugal can be easy to travel without a car, but not every part of
          the country is equally convenient by train. In some places a rental
          car adds freedom; in others it adds parking, traffic, and unnecessary
          complication.
        </p>

        <p>
          The useful question is not whether Portugal is a train trip or a
          driving trip. It is which form of transportation makes sense for
          each part of your itinerary.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="planning-feature">
      <div class="planning-image">
        <img
          src="/images/lisbon-santa-luzia-alfama-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers overlooking the rooftops of Alfama in Lisbon"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="planning-content">
        <p class="section-label">Choose your bases</p>

        <h2>Stay put—or move on?</h2>

        <p>
          Changing hotels can put you closer to the experience you came for,
          but every move also costs time. Packing, checking out, traveling,
          and checking in can quietly consume a vacation.
        </p>

        <p>
          Portugal Considered helps you decide when another overnight base
          improves the trip and when a day trip lets you see more by moving
          less.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-directory">
    <div class="guide-directory-inner">
      <div class="guide-directory-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Portugal trip planning guides</p>

        <h2>Make the important decisions first.</h2>

        <p>
          Start with the question that is shaping your trip. These guides are
          designed to help you decide how much time a place deserves, where to
          stay, when to move, and which experiences are worth building into
          your vacation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-groups">
        <section class="guide-group">
          <p class="section-label">Start with your time</p>

          <h3>How long should you stay?</h3>

          <div class="guide-links">
            <a href="/trip-planning/how-many-days-portugal/">
              How Many Days Do You Need in Portugal?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-many-days-porto-douro/">
              How Many Days in Porto &amp; the Douro Valley?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-many-days-lisbon-sintra/">
              How Many Days in Lisbon &amp; Sintra?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-many-days-algarve/">
              How Many Days in the Algarve?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-many-days-madeira/">
              How Many Days in Madeira?
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-group">
          <p class="section-label">Choose your base and transportation</p>

          <h3>Where should you stay—and how should you move?</h3>

          <div class="guide-links">
            <a href="/trip-planning/where-to-stay-lisbon/">
              Where to Stay in Lisbon
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/where-to-stay-douro-valley/">
              Where to Stay in the Douro Valley
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/douro-valley-without-car/">
              Douro Valley Without a Car
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-group">
          <p class="section-label">Make the day-trip decisions</p>

          <h3>When should you stay overnight?</h3>

          <div class="guide-links">
            <a href="/trip-planning/sintra-day-trip-or-overnight/">
              Sintra Day Trip or Overnight?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-to-plan-a-day-in-sintra/">
              How to Plan a Day in Sintra
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/evora-day-trip-or-overnight/">
              Évora Day Trip or Overnight?
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-group">
          <p class="section-label">Decide what deserves your time</p>

          <h3>Choose the experiences that make the trip better.</h3>

          <div class="guide-links">
            <a href="/trip-planning/what-is-worth-seeing-in-lisbon/">
              What Is Worth Seeing in Lisbon?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/what-is-worth-seeing-in-evora/">
              What Is Worth Seeing in Évora?
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-to-experience-alentejo-beyond-evora/">
              How to Experience the Alentejo Beyond Évora
            </a>

            <a href="/trip-planning/how-to-choose-douro-wine-tour/">
              How to Choose a Douro Valley Wine Tour
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="decision-section">
    <div class="decision-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Put the pieces together</p>

      <h2>Plan the trip before you book the pieces.</h2>

      <p>
        Hotels, trains, rental cars, tours, and transfers make more sense once
        you know what the trip is trying to accomplish. We start with the
        travel decision first, then help you identify the booking options that
        support it.
      </p>

      <a href="/destinations/">Explore Portugal's destinations →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .planning-intro {
    padding: 90px 28px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .planning-intro-inner {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-green);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .planning-section {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 28px 80px;
  }

  .planning-feature {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 65px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
  }

  .planning-feature-reverse .planning-image {
    order: 2;
  }

  .planning-feature-reverse .planning-content {
    order: 1;
  }

  .planning-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 390px;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .planning-content h2,
  .decision-section h2,
  .guide-directory-intro h2 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .planning-content p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .guide-directory {
    padding: 80px 28px;
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
  }

  .guide-directory-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .guide-directory-intro {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  .guide-directory-intro p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .guide-groups {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .guide-group {
    padding: 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
  }

  .guide-group h3 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .guide-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .guide-links a {
    display: block;
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .guide-links a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .decision-section {
    padding: 75px 28px 80px;
    background: var(--color-sand);
  }

  .decision-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .decision-section p {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .decision-section a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .decision-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .planning-feature {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 50px 0;
    }

    .planning-feature-reverse .planning-image,
    .planning-feature-reverse .planning-content {
      order: initial;
    }

    .planning-image img {
      height: 320px;
    }

    .guide-groups {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .planning-intro {
      padding: 65px 22px 55px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .planning-section {
      padding: 10px 22px 55px;
    }

    .planning-feature {
      padding: 42px 0;
    }

    .planning-image img {
      height: 250px;
    }

    .planning-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .guide-directory {
      padding: 55px 22px;
    }

    .guide-directory-intro {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .guide-directory-intro p:last-child {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .guide-group {
      padding: 25px 22px;
    }

    .guide-group h3 {
      font-size: 23px;
    }

    .decision-section {
      padding: 55px 22px 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
